{"4109780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gachanimals", "steam_appid": 4109780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109780/extras/be289b62b7c1f952ec7122db44ccf814.avif?t=1773251815\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gachanimals</strong> is a relaxing life/simulator prototype where you run your very own gachapon store in an animal-filled town. Decorate your shelves, restock your capsule machines, and watch as curious customers wander in to see what surprises await inside each toy capsule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Decorate &amp; Display:</strong> Show off your favorite collectibles and design the cozy storefront of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109780/extras/124cd944aeb0364b1c4acbb8286d50ea.poster.avif?t=1773251815\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109780/extras/124cd944aeb0364b1c4acbb8286d50ea.webm?t=1773251815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109780/extras/124cd944aeb0364b1c4acbb8286d50ea.mp4?t=1773251815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Gentle Vibes:</strong> No timers or stress — just a calm, loop of collecting, decorating, and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Friendly Customers:</strong> Dogs stroll in and browse your shop, each with their own charm and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Gachapon Machines:</strong> Stock, price, and spin your machines to keep visitors coming back for new figurines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap